{"6":[{"k":"p","t":"DIGGER SOUNDS"},{"k":"p","t":"BACKGROUND SOUND is used anytime creatures are present in the maze. This sound speeds up with the creatures' speed. An ESCAPE SOUND is used as the creatures rush through the gate into the maze area. A DOUBLE BONUS SOUND is used when the red creature is the first captured. Another BONUS SOUND is heard when the 1000 POINT BONUS is awarded. A beeping CREATURE SOUND that squeaks when a creature falls into a hole. A SCORING SOUND accompanies the flashing score display after a creature is buried. A SCREECH SOUND is used when your man is eaten by a creature. A RELEASE SOUND is used when a creature leaves a hole. A GAME-OVER BOOM is heard at the end of the game."},{"k":"p","t":"OPTIONS SELECT..."},{"k":"p","t":"DIP SWITCH # i 2 No. of Men"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   off   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"UPRIGHT   on   off   4"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   on   5"},{"k":"tr","t":"on   on   6"},{"k":"p","t":"DIP SWITCH # 1 2 No. of Men"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   off   5"},{"k":"tr","t":"COCKTAIL   on   off   4"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   on   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"on   on   2"}],"13":[{"k":"p","t":"RECOMMENDED SPARE PARTS for SINGLE games"},{"k":"p","t":"GREMLIN WHERE PART NO. USED DESCRIPTION"},{"k":"tr","t":"130-0001   a   speaker"},{"k":"tr","t":"130-0002   a   speaker cover"},{"k":"tr","t":"200-0014   u   19\" color monitor"},{"k":"tr","t":"200-0015   s   color monitor"},{"k":"tr","t":"200-0013   c   13'' color monitor"},{"k":"tr","t":"253-0104   u   plexi, front monitor panel"},{"k":"tr","t":"390-0011   u   fluorescent lamp"},{"k":"tr","t":"220-0035   u   coin door lock & key"},{"k":"tr","t":"220-0097   s   cylinder lock   ,"},{"k":"tr","t":"117-0126   s   coin entry plate, USA"},{"k":"tr","t":"220-0066   u   coin mechanism, complete"},{"k":"tr","t":"800-0103   cs   coin mechanism, complete"},{"k":"tr","t":"220-0071   u   coin reject button & spring"},{"k":"tr","t":"240-0097   s   reject button assy."},{"k":"tr","t":"220-0072   u   coin return stop (u-bolt)"